          "config": {
            "id": "office_heater_smart_control",
            "alias": "Office Heater Smart Control",
            "description": "Heats the office (climate.office_heater_2) to 21\u00b0C while the office mmWave sees someone AND the room is below 20\u00b0C (the cold trigger also re-heats during continuous occupancy); off after 30 min empty or once the room passes 23\u00b0C. Blocked while house_away is on \u2014 the mmWave is cat-trippable and away-mode owns the heater then. Fixed 2026-07-10: previous version read the Pi CPU temperature as the room temp and toggled the child-lock switch instead of the heater.",
